### 13. State Machine Compiler
For protocol implementations and game AI:
```assembly
; Define state machine in declarative form
state_machine TCPConnection {
    states: CLOSED, LISTEN, SYN_SENT, SYN_RECEIVED, ESTABLISHED
    events: OPEN, SEND, RECEIVE, CLOSE, TIMEOUT
    transitions:
        CLOSED + OPEN -> LISTEN
        LISTEN + RECEIVE -> SYN_RECEIVED
        ; ...
    actions:
        on LISTEN: send_syn_ack
        on ESTABLISHED: notify_application
}

; Compiles to jump table + action dispatch
; Generates verification tests
```

